  "html": "\n<a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link\">Skip to content</a><div id=\"reading-progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Reading progress\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div><header class=\"mobile-header\"><button class=\"mobile-menu-toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle Menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span></span> <span></span> <span></span></button><a href=\"/\" class=\"mobile-logo\" aria-label=\"ConstBooth\"><img src=\"/assets/logo.svg?v=35ddb567\" alt=\"ConstBooth\" class=\"logo-img\" width=\"112\" height=\"30\"></a><div class=\"mobile-header-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></header><div class=\"mobile-menu-overlay\"></div><nav class=\"mobile-menu-drawer\" aria-label=\"Navigation Menu\"><div class=\"mobile-menu-drawer-header\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"mobile-menu-drawer-logo\" aria-label=\"ConstBooth\"><img src=\"/assets/logo.svg?v=35ddb567\" alt=\"ConstBooth\" class=\"logo-img\" width=\"112\" height=\"30\"></a><button class=\"mobile-menu-close\" aria-label=\"Close Menu\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div><div class=\"mobile-menu-links\"><a href=\"/#booth-types\">Booths</a> <a href=\"/studio\">Studio</a> <a href=\"/#how\">How it works</a> <a href=\"/blog\">Blog</a> <a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><div class=\"mobile-menu-divider\"></div><div class=\"mobile-menu-actions\"><a href=\"/booth\" class=\"drawer-cta-primary\"><svg class=\"cta-icon-camera\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;vertical-align:-.15em;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0\"><path d=\"M14.5 4h-5L7 7H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3l-2.5-3z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3\"/></svg><span>Enter Photobooth</span></a><a href=\"/studio\" class=\"drawer-cta-secondary\" aria-label=\"Explore Studio\"><svg class=\"cta-grid-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;vertical-align:-.15em;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0\"><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"14\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"14\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"/></svg><span>Explore Studio</span></a></div><div class=\"mobile-menu-footer\"><span class=\"mobile-menu-footer-brand\">ConstBooth<br><span style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal\">One frame. Beyond distance.</span></span><span class=\"mobile-menu-footer-version\">v2.0.0</span></div></nav><header class=\"main-header full-header\"><div class=\"header-left\"><a href=\"/\" id=\"logo-trigger-top\" class=\"app-logo\" aria-label=\"ConstBooth\"><img src=\"/assets/logo.svg?v=35ddb567\" alt=\"ConstBooth\" class=\"logo-img\" width=\"134\" height=\"36\"></a></div><nav class=\"header-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/#booth-types\">Booths</a> <a href=\"/studio\">Studio</a> <a href=\"/#how\">How it works</a> <a href=\"/blog\">Blog</a> <a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"header-actions\"><a href=\"/booth\" class=\"nav-cta\"><svg class=\"cta-icon-camera\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:1.18em;height:1.18em;vertical-align:-.18em;margin-right:7px;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0\"><path d=\"M14.5 4h-5L7 7H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3l-2.5-3z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3\"/></svg><span>Enter Photobooth</span></a></div></header><main id=\"main-content\"><div class=\"blog-page-wrap\"><section class=\"blog-hero blog-hero-nowrap\"><nav class=\"blog-eyebrow reveal\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"blog-eyebrow-link\">Home</a><span class=\"blog-crumb-sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&middot;</span><a href=\"/blog\" class=\"blog-eyebrow-link\">Blog</a></nav><h1 class=\"reveal delay-1\">How to Create <span class=\"accent\">Photo Strips</span> Online</h1><p class=\"blog-hero-sub reveal delay-2\">A step-by-step guide to making beautiful <a href=\"/booth\" class=\"inline-link\">photo strips</a> from your browser no apps, no hardware required.</p><div class=\"blog-meta reveal delay-3\"><div class=\"blog-meta-author\"><div class=\"blog-meta-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg></div><span class=\"blog-meta-name\"><a href=\"/about#author\">Kishan Naik</a></span></div><div class=\"blog-meta-divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"blog-meta-date\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;opacity:.5\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/></svg> June 17, 2026</span><div class=\"blog-meta-divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"blog-meta-read\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;opacity:.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg> 5 min read</span></div></section><div class=\"blog-container\"><aside class=\"lb-rail lb-rail--blog lb-rail--follow lb-rail--l\" data-rail=\"blog\" aria-label=\"Advertisement\"><div class=\"lb-rail-ad\"></div></aside><aside class=\"lb-rail lb-rail--blog lb-rail--follow lb-rail--r\" data-rail=\"blog\" aria-label=\"Advertisement\"><div class=\"lb-rail-ad\"></div></aside>\n<article class=\"blog-body\" id=\"blog-article\"><section class=\"blog-section\"><p class=\"reveal\">Photo strips have a special quality. Four frames arranged in a column, each one a split second apart they tell a small story. They used to require a physical booth in a shopping mall or event venue. Now, you can create them entirely online, from your phone or laptop, with nothing to download.</p><p class=\"reveal delay-1\">This guide walks you through exactly how to do it.</p></section><section class=\"blog-section\" aria-labelledby=\"s1\"><h2 id=\"s1\" class=\"reveal\">What Are Photo Strips?</h2><p class=\"reveal delay-1\">A photo strip is a series of photos typically three or four printed or displayed in a vertical sequence. The format originated in analog photo booths, where a roll of film was exposed rapidly and developed on the spot. The result was a narrow strip of moments captured seconds apart.</p><p class=\"reveal delay-2\">Online photo strips follow the same format, but everything happens in your browser. The camera captures your frames, the interface assembles them, and within seconds you have a finished strip ready to download or share.</p></section>\n\n<section class=\"blog-section\" aria-labelledby=\"s2\"><h2 id=\"s2\" class=\"reveal\">Why Create Photo Strips Online?</h2><p class=\"reveal delay-1\">There are several practical advantages to using an <a href=\"/blog/what-is-a-virtual-photo-booth\" class=\"inline-link\">online photo booth</a> over a physical one.</p><div class=\"blog-benefits-grid reveal delay-2\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"blog-card blog-benefit-card\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"blog-icon\" style=\"background:#ffe100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z\"/><path d=\"M2 17l10 5 10-5\"/><path d=\"M2 12l10 5 10-5\"/></svg></div><div class=\"blog-benefit-title\">No location required</div><div class=\"blog-benefit-desc\">Use it from home, work, or anywhere in the world no physical booth needed.</div></div><div class=\"blog-card blog-benefit-card\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"blog-icon\" style=\"background:#2ab09c\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"2\" width=\"14\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"18\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></div><div class=\"blog-benefit-title\">Works on any device</div><div class=\"blog-benefit-desc\">Phone, tablet, or computer your camera is already there. No extra hardware needed.</div></div><div class=\"blog-card blog-benefit-card\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"blog-icon\" style=\"background:#ff6de4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg></div><div class=\"blog-benefit-title\">Instant results</div><div class=\"blog-benefit-desc\">Your strip is assembled in real time. Download it the moment you're done.</div></div><div class=\"blog-card blog-benefit-card\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"blog-icon\" style=\"background:#4da6ff\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg></div><div class=\"blog-benefit-title\">Share with friends</div><div class=\"blog-benefit-desc\">Shoot with others remotely using a shared booth link no one needs to be in the same room.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"blog-section\" aria-labelledby=\"s3\"><h2 id=\"s3\" class=\"reveal\">Step 1: Choose a Virtual Photo Booth</h2><p class=\"reveal delay-1\">Not all online photo booth tools are equal. Look for one that runs entirely in the browser, requires no sign-up, and gives you clean, downloadable results. <a href=\"/booth\" class=\"inline-link\">ConstBooth</a> is a <a href=\"/blog/what-is-a-virtual-photo-booth\" class=\"inline-link\">virtual photo booth</a> built for exactly this open it, and you're ready to shoot within seconds.</p><p class=\"reveal delay-2\">The key things to look for:</p><div class=\"blog-lb-box reveal delay-3\"><ul class=\"blog-lb-list\"><li class=\"blog-lb-item\"><svg class=\"blog-lb-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg><span>Works directly in the browser no downloads</span></li><li class=\"blog-lb-item\"><svg class=\"blog-lb-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg><span>Solo and shared booth modes</span></li><li class=\"blog-lb-item\"><svg class=\"blog-lb-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg><span>Instant strip generation</span></li><li class=\"blog-lb-item\"><svg class=\"blog-lb-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg><span>High-quality downloadable output</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"blog-section\" aria-labelledby=\"s4\"><h2 id=\"s4\" class=\"reveal\">Step 2: Capture Your Photos</h2><p class=\"reveal delay-1\">Once you're in the booth, the camera activates. Most virtual photo booths use a countdown timer before each shot giving you a few seconds to get into position. With ConstBooth, the process is automatic: the booth counts down and snaps, repeating until your strip is full.</p><p class=\"reveal delay-2\">A few things that make the shots better:</p><div class=\"blog-lb-box reveal delay-3\"><ul class=\"blog-lb-list\"><li class=\"blog-lb-item\"><svg class=\"blog-lb-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg><span>Use natural light when possible face a window for even lighting</span></li><li class=\"blog-lb-item\"><svg class=\"blog-lb-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg><span>Keep the camera at eye level to avoid awkward angles</span></li><li class=\"blog-lb-item\"><svg class=\"blog-lb-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg><span>Change your expression or pose between frames for variety</span></li></ul></div></section>\n<section class=\"blog-section\" aria-labelledby=\"s5\"><h2 id=\"s5\" class=\"reveal\">Step 3: Generate Your Photo Strip</h2><p class=\"reveal delay-1\">After capturing your frames, the <a href=\"/strips\" class=\"inline-link\">photo strip maker</a> assembles them into a single image automatically. This is where the format comes to life four individual moments become a single, cohesive strip. The vertical layout creates a sense of time passing, making even simple poses feel narrative. You can choose classic 3-frame or Korean 4-cut (Life4Cuts) vertical strips, as well as Polaroid-style instant frames.</p><p class=\"reveal delay-2\">With a good online tool, this happens instantly. No waiting, no rendering queues.</p></section><section class=\"blog-section\" aria-labelledby=\"s6\"><h2 id=\"s6\" class=\"reveal\">Step 4: Download and Share</h2><p class=\"reveal delay-1\">Once your strip is generated, you can download it directly to your device. From there, share it however you like via message, social media, or save it to your camera roll. The file is a standard image, so it works everywhere.</p><p class=\"reveal delay-2\">If you were in a shared booth session, every participant gets access to the same strip meaning long-distance friends get the same memory, at the same time.</p></section><section class=\"blog-section\" aria-labelledby=\"s7\"><h2 id=\"s7\" class=\"reveal\">Create Photo Strips with ConstBooth</h2><p class=\"reveal delay-1\"><a href=\"/booth\" class=\"inline-link\">ConstBooth</a> is a browser-based <a href=\"/blog/what-is-a-virtual-photo-booth\" class=\"inline-link\">virtual photo booth</a> designed to make <a href=\"/booth\" class=\"inline-link\">photo strips online</a> as easy as possible. There's no account to create, no app to install. Open the link, pick your booth mode, and start shooting.</p><div class=\"blog-steps-grid reveal delay-2\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"blog-card blog-step-card\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"blog-icon\" style=\"background:#ffe100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg></div><div class=\"blog-step-title\">Solo Booth</div><div class=\"blog-step-desc\">Just you and your camera create a strip of your own moments.</div></div><div class=\"blog-card blog-step-card\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"blog-icon\" style=\"background:#2ab09c\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14.5 4h-5L7 7H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3l-2.5-3z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3\"/></svg></div><div class=\"blog-step-title\">Shared Booth</div><div class=\"blog-step-desc\">Invite friends via link step into the same frame from different locations.</div></div><div class=\"blog-card blog-step-card\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"blog-icon\" style=\"background:#ff6de4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 3v18\"/><path d=\"M3 7.5h4\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18\"/><path d=\"M3 16.5h4\"/><path d=\"M17 3v18\"/><path d=\"M17 7.5h4\"/><path d=\"M17 16.5h4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"blog-step-title\">Instant Strip</div><div class=\"blog-step-desc\">Your frames are assembled automatically ready to download in seconds.</div></div><div class=\"blog-card blog-step-card\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"blog-icon\" style=\"background:#4da6ff\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"/><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></div><div class=\"blog-step-title\">Download & Share</div><div class=\"blog-step-desc\">Save your strip and share it wherever you like no account needed.</div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"blog-section\" aria-labelledby=\"s8\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><h2 id=\"s8\" class=\"reveal\">Final Thoughts</h2><p class=\"reveal delay-1\">Creating <a href=\"/booth\" class=\"inline-link\">photo strips online</a> has never been more accessible. Whether you want a quick solo session or a shared moment with friends across the world, the process takes under a minute from start to finish.</p><p class=\"reveal delay-2\">The format is simple. The results feel personal. That's what makes photo strips worth making.</p><p class=\"reveal delay-3\">Explore more on the <a href=\"/blog\" class=\"inline-link\">ConstBooth blog</a> or try it yourself with our guide on <a href=\"/blog/10-creative-photo-strip-ideas\" class=\"inline-link\">creative photo strip ideas</a>.</p></section>\n<section class=\"blog-section\" aria-labelledby=\"faq\"><h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"reveal\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><h2 class=\"reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px\">Is there a free online photobooth without downloading an app?</h2><p class=\"reveal delay-1\">Yes. <a href=\"/booth\" class=\"inline-link\">ConstBooth</a> is 100% free with no app downloads, no subscriptions, and no paywalls. You can open the website in any modern browser, shoot photo strips immediately as a guest, and download your finished strips with zero watermarks.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><h2 class=\"reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px\">How do I take photobooth pictures with a friend far away?</h2><p class=\"reveal delay-1\">Use ConstBooth's <a href=\"/booth\" class=\"inline-link\">Shared Booth</a> mode. Create a session, send the private room link to your partner or friend, and both of your cameras will connect in the same browser window. The synchronized countdown snaps simultaneous frames and places both of you on one combined strip.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><h2 class=\"reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px\">Can I print the photo strips I create online?</h2><p class=\"reveal delay-1\">Yes. ConstBooth exports high-resolution strips at 300 DPI (standard 2x6 inches), making them suitable for home printing on 4x6 photo paper or printing through local photo print services.</p></div></section>\n\n\n<div class=\"blog-tag-row\" aria-label=\"Article tags\"><span class=\"blog-tag-label\">Filed under</span><a class=\"blog-tag-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/beginners\" rel=\"tag\">Beginner Guides</a><a class=\"blog-tag-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/photo-strips\" rel=\"tag\">Photo Strips</a></div><section class=\"blog-related\" aria-labelledby=\"related-heading\"><h2 id=\"related-heading\" class=\"blog-related-title\">Keep reading</h2><div class=\"blog-related-grid\"><a class=\"blog-related-card\" href=\"/blog/how-to-share-photo-strips-on-instagram\"><span class=\"blog-related-cat\">Guides</span><span class=\"blog-related-h\">How to Share Photo Strips on Instagram</span><span class=\"blog-related-p\">Why Instagram crops your strip in half, the exact canvas sizes that stop it, and how to keep the quality intact.</span></a><a class=\"blog-related-card\" href=\"/blog/photo-strip-sizes-and-dimensions\"><span class=\"blog-related-cat\">Guides</span><span class=\"blog-related-h\">Photo Strip Sizes and Dimensions Explained</span><span class=\"blog-related-p\">Every size in inches, millimetres and pixels - plus frame ratios, margins, and the rules for designing your own template.</span></a><a class=\"blog-related-card\" href=\"/blog/how-to-print-photo-strips-at-home\"><span class=\"blog-related-cat\">Guides</span><span class=\"blog-related-h\">How to Print Photo Strips at Home</span><span class=\"blog-related-p\">The right size, the right resolution and the printer settings nobody tells you about - a complete home printing walkthrough.</span></a><a class=\"blog-related-card\" href=\"/blog/what-is-a-virtual-photo-booth\"><span class=\"blog-related-cat\">Guides</span><span class=\"blog-related-h\">What Is a Virtual Photo Booth?</span><span class=\"blog-related-p\">Learn how virtual photo booths work, why they're becoming popular, and how to create photo strips online from anywhere.</span></a></div></section><section class=\"blog-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sources-heading\" style=\"margin-top:48px\"><h2 id=\"sources-heading\" class=\"reveal\">Sources and further reading</h2><ul class=\"blog-list reveal delay-1\"><li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/MediaDevices/getUserMedia\" class=\"inline-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MDN: MediaDevices.getUserMedia()</a> - The browser API behind every camera prompt, and why a secure context and an explicit user grant are both required.</li><li><a href=\"https://caniuse.com/stream\" class=\"inline-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Can I use: getUserMedia / Stream API</a> - Current browser support for camera access, which decides whether a browser booth works on a given device.</li></ul></section><div style=\"margin-top:48px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/blog\" class=\"inline-link\" style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:600\">&larr; Back to blog</a></div>\n\n</article></div></div></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><div class=\"footer-logo\"><a href=\"/\" aria-label=\"ConstBooth\"><img src=\"/assets/logo-footer.svg?v=b1cb43c4\" alt=\"ConstBooth\" class=\"footer-logo-img\" width=\"134\" height=\"36\"></a></div><p class=\"footer-tagline\">One frame. Beyond distance.</p><div class=\"footer-socials\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/app.lensbooth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"footer-social-link\" aria-label=\"Instagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" ry=